 in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/wisconsin/forest-county"],["ARC or PLC in Forest County","/arc-plc/wisconsin/forest-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Forest County record runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 13 grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those 75 years. In 2025, October to November landed at 57% of normal on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, June to July sits at 88% of normal on the middle. Grid 30464 had its driest year in 1989 at 62% of normal.</p>"}
